    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ElevenLabs voice bridge\n\nThis is the **ElevenLabs orchestration** pattern: ElevenLabs runs the voice agent and calls this n8n webhook as a tool, so you get low latency and keep business logic in n8n.\n\n1. Activate this workflow (use the Production URL).\n2. In ElevenLabs, add a tool pointing at the Production URL.\n3. Send the user's text as `{ \"message\": \"...\" }`.\n4. The response is plain text, ready for TTS.\n\nFor the n8n-orchestration pattern (STT -> agent -> TTS in one workflow), see `week2/README.md` Day 5 and `voice.html`.",
